{
  "name": "schemaform_daisyui",
  "description": "schemaform-dioxus renderers for daisyUI: a control renderer presenting string, number, integer, boolean, choice, and constant controls with the registry's Field, Input, Checkbox, NativeSelect, RadioGroup, and Select parts; a structure bundle rendering homogeneous arrays as cards with joined item actions and the form shell with a primary submit button; and a finding presenter framing the summary as an alert.",
